FerrionOS change to base (MIT license, kept), made against upstream commit 20f7573b4dc011ea5267189185edc0b2f12bab0f with the FerrionOS patches before it in recipe.toml applied, ferrion-gpu-fences.patch last among them. A blob's GEM handle is known to submissions from its creation to its GEM_CLOSE: EXECBUFFER accepts it in bo_handles and WAIT waits for the last submission that named it; after GEM_CLOSE both answer ENOENT and the blob's fence is dropped.

